diff:1295308699:1295308399:=411,427c411,419%0a%3c [[http://www.remyvd.com/Set_up_XDMCP_connection_on_Ubuntu_10.04_LTS_and_log_in_with_a_Windows_domain_user|Set up XDMCP connection on Ubuntu 10.04 LTS and add it to a Windows domain]]\\%0a%3c [[http://ubuntuforums.org/showthread.php?t=1575581|xdmcp connection]]\\%0a%3c [[http://ubuntuforums.org/showthread.php?t=1471703|xdmcp in 10.04]]\\%0a%3c %0a%3c TFTPD-HPA\\%0a%3c [[http://wiki.nosdigitais.teia.org.br/Diskless#Servidor:_TFPT-HPA|Diskless Servidor: TFPT-HPA]]\\%0a%3c [[https://help.ubuntu.com/community/Installation/Netboot|Netboot Install]]\\%0a%3c [[http://blogs.techrepublic.com.com/opensource/?p=176|Set up a TFTP server for easy network boots and firmware upgrades]]\\%0a%3c [[http://blog.tuxcoder.com/2008/06/configure-tftp-server-in-ubuntu.html|Configure TFTPD Server in Ubuntu]]%0a%3c %0a%3c %0a%3c %0a%3c %0a%3c %0a%3c %0a%3c %0a%3c %0a---%0a> [[http://www.remyvd.com/Set_up_XDMCP_connection_on_Ubuntu_10.04_LTS_and_log_in_with_a_Windows_domain_user|Set up XDMCP connection on Ubuntu 10.04 LTS and add it to a Windows domain]]%0a> [[http://ubuntuforums.org/showthread.php?t=1575581|xdmcp connection]]%0a> [[http://ubuntuforums.org/showthread.php?t=1471703|xdmcp in 10.04]]%0a> %0a> %0a> %0a> %0a> %0a> %0a
